OL,3,AClose-up images to be revealed of
OL,4,Aasteroid deliberately hit to test
OL,5,Aability to protect Earth
OL,6,
OL,7,FA spacecraft has arrived at an asteroid
OL,8,Fto investigate the damage caused by an
OL,9,Funprecedented cosmic crash.
OL,11,FIn what may sound like the plot of a
OL,12,Fdisaster movie, Nasa's Dart spacecraft
OL,13,Fdeliberately smashed into the space
OL,14,Frock in 2022 to knock it off course.
OL,16,FThe Nasa craft was obliterated on
OL,17,Fimpact. Four years on, a European Space
OL,18,FAgency (ESA) mission, called Hera, is
OL,19,Fscouring the scene to fully assess the
OL,20,Faftermath of the collision - with the
OL,21,Ffirst images set to be released later
OL,22,Fon Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
